WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.003
Gaal:
Only we can shorten the
darkness.

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.087
♪♪

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.088
(Growling)

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:11.803
♪♪

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:14.723
David Goyer:
People have been trying to make
Foundation for over fifty years. 

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:18.852
Foundation was an enormous
influence for Star Wars. 

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:22.898
David Goyer:
It was the greatest science
fiction work of all time.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:26.068
David Goyer:    
The story is sprawling, the
scope is sprawling.

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:28.070
David Goyer:
It unfolds over the course of a
thousand years.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.781
♪♪

00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:32.866
David Goyer:
If ever there were a company

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.494
David Goyer:
that was hoping to sort of,
better people’s lives

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:38.121
David Goyer:
through technology, through
connectivity, it’s Apple.

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:41.291
David Goyer:
And that’s something very much
that Asimov was hoping to do.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:59.476
♪♪

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.311
They're going to arrest me
tomorrow...and you.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.771
♪♪

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.898
It's almost a certainty.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:10.946
♪♪

00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:13.156
Hari:
You're familiar with my work,
psychohistory?

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:15.701
Yes... in theory, but I don't
know what it has to do with...

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:16.493
It's not a theory.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:21.456
♪♪

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.834
Salvor:
They’re worried you can predict
the future.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:27.713
♪♪

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:30.090
Hari:
They're worried people believe I
can.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.428
♪♪

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:36.430
Hari:
And they don't like the future I
predict.

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:42.436
♪♪

00:01:42.436 --> 00:01:43.770
Hari:
The empire will fall.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.938
♪♪

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.273
Hari:
Order will vanish.

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:47.733
♪♪

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:50.694
Hari:
These massive events rushing to
meet us.

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:51.528
♪♪

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:52.863
(Growling)

00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:54.990
♪♪

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.743
Gaal:
Only we can shorten the
darkness.

00:01:57.743 --> 00:02:15.510
♪♪

